render_lab's math animation library
===================================

The library that builds math scenes (lab/src/math/), which the lab's canvas draws: written in the next change.

$[Import* std]$[Import* render_lab_runtime]$[ImportAs rl_runtime rt]

Fn([Float, Float], Vec2). A point on the canvas.
$[# {v2 x y} {: {. x x y y} Vec2}]
